  "description": "<p>Testsuite test failed:</p>\n<div class='table-wrap'>\n<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#link-acl-on-create\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">5.4-B</a></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>MUST</td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>FAIL</td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>The server must reject the request and respond with a 4xx or 5xx range status code, such as 409 (Conflict) if it isn't able to create the LDPR with the specified LDP-RS as the ACL. In that response, the restrictions causing the request to fail must be described in a resource indicated by a rel=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#constrainedBy\" link in the Link response header</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n\n\n<p>API Reference: <a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#link-acl-on-create\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#link-acl-on-create</a></p>\n\n<p>For help running the test suite: </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FF/Fedora+API+Specification+Test+Suite\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FF/Fedora+API+Specification+Test+Suite</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>",
